From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ophuscado <postbox@ophuscado.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 17:54:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/10] phy: apple: atc: Take the driver from asahi-wip-7.2 for
 USB4

The stock driver stops at "ATCPHY_PIPEHANDLER_STATE_USB4 not
implemented". asahi-wip-7.2 at 236788cd2602 implements that state
(Sven Peter: DUMMY pipehandler state, PIPE mux sequence, USB4
pipehandler state) and adds M3 support (Sasha Finkelstein). The file is
taken from there; it binds to the same device-tree nodes as before.

Check: phy-apple-atc builds in the full build of this tree.
---
 drivers/phy/apple/atc.c | 202 ++++++++++++++++++++++++----------------
 1 file changed, 120 insertions(+), 82 deletions(-)

